          "text": "\t\t\t\ttypes.ErrPacketSequenceOutOfOrder,"
        },
        {
          "n": 237,
          "text": "\t\t\t\t\"packet sequence \u2260 next receive sequence (%d \u2260 %d)\", packet.GetSequence(), nextSequenceRecv,"
